13:T5da,Indulge in a gastronomic journey like no other with our continental cooking masterclass!  Are you ready to embark on a culinary adventure that will transport your taste buds to far-off lands and introduce you to the rich tapestry of global flavors?  Join us for an immersive experience where you`ll master the art of cooking authentic dishes from various countries.  🌍 What to Expect:  Expert Guidance: Our seasoned chefs will guide you through the intricacies of each cuisine, sharing time-honored recipes and culinary secrets.  Cultural Insights: Learn about the history and traditions that influence each dish, gaining a deeper appreciation for the cultures that created them.  Hands-On Cooking: Roll up your sleeves and prepare a delectable feast from start to finish, using the freshest ingredients and authentic cooking techniques.  Culinary Connection: Connect with fellow food enthusiasts, share stories, and forge lasting bonds over a shared love for international cuisine.   Whether you`re eager to craft Italian pasta, savor the spices of Indian curries, or explore the umami of Japanese sushi, this workshop promises an unforgettable culinary experience.  Don`t miss this opportunity to broaden your culinary horizons and become a global chef in your own kitchen! Book your spot now and get ready to embark on a culinary world tour with us! 🍽️🌏✨ Duration: 1 hour 30 minutes. Languages: Bengali, English, Hindi, Kannada. Artists: shall be implied. 657 people are interested.7:["$","$L12",null,{"initialActivity":{"id":"63","title":"Continental Cooking Masterclass","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-continental-cooking-masterclass-0-2024-3-14-t-6-22-21.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹999","location":"minutesAll age groupsBengali, English, Hindi, Kannada, Malaya...Brik Oven, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2","6","8","9"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$13","date":"Sat 18 Apr 2026","time":"01: